in)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RAD52</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RAD52 homologue (<italic>S. cerevisiae</italic>)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">XRCC3</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">X-ray repair complementing defective repair in Chinese hamster cells 3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">BRCA1</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Breast cancer 1, early onset</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label/><p>Only homologous recombination genes represented on our microarrays are listed (see main text).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>